{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14986","headline":"和徐法曹赠崔洛阳斑竹杖以诗见荅 · 卢纶","name":"和徐法曹赠崔洛阳斑竹杖以诗见荅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉干一寻余，苔花锦不如。\n劲堪和醉倚，轻好向空书。\n采拂稽山曲，因依释氏居。\n方辰将独步，岂与此君疎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14986.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14986","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}